Subject: merge OpenCL configuration from UAPI directories
Source: Nex downstream patch for OpenCL ICD Loader v2026.05.29
Upstream: not submitted; needs agreement on Unix vendor and transient paths

Merge ICD and layer registration files by basename from /etc, /run, and
/usr/share. Higher directories replace lower files with the same name; empty
files and links to /dev/null mask lower registrations. Keep the secure
environment overrides as single-directory replacements.

